{
  "//": [
    "Rollways and Grabbers -- the ground layer. Nothing here rises above 0.5 m,",
    "so a belt run never blocks the silhouette of the machine it feeds.",
    "",
    "BELT_ children carry the scrolling-UV shader, so belt motion is free; the",
    "items riding on top are instanced separately.",
    "",
    "A grabber's ANIM_ children nest: Arm0 -> Arm1 -> Hand. The joint hierarchy",
    "IS the animation -- rotating Arm0 carries the forearm and hand with it, the",
    "way a real linkage does. `at` is each joint's local origin.",
    "",
    "Ported from modelgen/gen_rollway.py. Blender was Z-up and this is Y-up, so",
    "what was z there is y here."
  ],

